<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Sugar shipments Feb. 1-28.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Sugar shipments Feb. 1-28.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipments of sugar and its products from Tanjung Priok Port Jakarta, in February, 1997, based on data made available to Reuters by the port authority.</p>
<p>* asterisk denotes export destinations</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SHIP	     DATE/DEPARTURE	CARGO/TONNES     DESTINATION</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Zangzasan-	  04-02-97	   sugar		S'pore*</p>
<p>Chongnyonho				12,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Lyong Gun Bong    05-02-97	   sugar		S'pore*</p>
<p>					     8,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Hun Jiang	   06-02-97	   sugar		Bangkok*</p>
<p>					     12,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Jidi	     11-02-97	   sugar		S'pore*</p>
<p>					     8,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Jin Gang Liang    21-02-97	   sugar		Bangkok*</p>
<p>					     6,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Great Concert     26-02-97	   sugar		Bangkok*</p>
<p>					     14,039 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
